   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Therefore, Jade Road's core strategy remains: to build a base of income generating assets that covers overheads, management fees and finance costs, with a growing surplus to fund dividends.",
   "file": "20220630_SHR_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-01",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Therefore, Jade Road's core strategy remains: to build a base of income generating assets that covers overheads, management fees and finance costs, with a growing surplus to fund dividends.",
   "file": "20220701_SHR_Replacement-for-Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-09-22",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Board is confident that significant opportunities exist for Jade Road going forward, particularly investment candidates in the IT, Fintech, Healthcare and online commerce sectors in Southeast Asia.",
   "file": "20220922_SHR_INTERIM-RESULTS-FOR-SIX-MONTHS-ENDED-30-JUNE-2022.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-05-26",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The past year has been challenging for the Company, but the Board now believes that by adopting a new investment strategy and accelerating the disposals of its legacy assets, it is in a strong position to fulfil its clear objective of providing shareholders with attractive uncorrelated, risk-adjusted, long-term returns to becoming a dividend paying vehicle.",
   "file": "20230526_SHR_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-09-29",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Future investments will be made in asset backed income-generating investments as the Company disposes of all of its legacy Asia-based assets and your Board hopes to be able to make further announcements on this in the near future.",
   "file": "20230929_SHR_INTERIM-RESULTS-FOR-SIX-MONTHS-ENDED-30-JUNE-2023.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-12-13",
   "doc": "OPS",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "In the meantime, significant progress has been made with the proposed sale of Future Metal Holdings, and the Company expects to announce details of this in due course.",
   "file": "20231213_SHR_Operational-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-06-28",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Company is confident that it will be able to raise the interim capital required, and is in advanced discussions with a number of parties with respect to this.",
   "file": "20240628_SHR_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-09-30",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Whilst the relationship with MBM Ltd. is embryonic, I am encouraged by the cooperation and support experienced to date and expect to be able to announce more details in the coming months.",
   "file": "20240930_SHR_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2025-09-24",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "As an immediate priority, the Company intends to deploy the capital from NOIA's investment in line with its Investing Policy prior to 29 November 2025 such that it would have substantially implemented the policy by that date.",
   "file": "20250924_SHR_INTERIM-RESULTS-FOR-SIX-MONTHS-ENDED-30-JUNE-2025.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2026-04-28",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY26",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "This further raise has positioned the Company, with the continuing strategic engagement of NOIA Capital, to raise further and more substantial new funding and to commence deployment in execution of its new Investment Strategy.",
   "file": "20260428_SHR_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2026-09-28",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY26",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We intend to approach this opportunity with careful investment selection, disciplined capital allocation and attention to the risks associated with a rapidly evolving sector.",
   "file": "20260928_SHR_Interim-results-for-six-months-ended-30-June-2026.md"
  }
 ],
